 "c": [
  {"i":5203,"t":["society","geography"],"s":{},"n":"A kingdom is a form of rule and also a kind of country (イギリス王国), so geography fits as a second unit."},
  {"i":5211,"t":["arts","hobbies"],"s":{"1":["media"]},"n":"Concerts and performances are the core. Live streaming (ライブ配信) is a common, separate media sense."},
  {"i":5216,"t":["work","technology"],"s":{},"n":"Office paper files and computer files are both core senses and are covered by t. A school/stationery link is weaker."},
  {"i":5225,"t":["health","clothing"],"s":{"2":["character"]},"n":"Face masks are health and clothing. 甘いマスク (good looks) is a common appearance sense, which belongs to character."},
  {"i":5229,"t":["city"],"s":{"3":["hobbies"],"6":["actions","sports"]},"n":"Qualities doesn't fit a concrete noun. City and concrete blocks are core. Toy blocks are hobbies. Blocking is an action and a sports term."},
  {"i":5233,"t":["routine"],"s":{"1":["weather"],"2":["movement"],"6":["weather"]},"n":"A mimetic word, not a function word. ゴロゴロする (lazing around) is the core learner use. Thunder senses are weather, and rolling is movement."},
  {"i":5236,"t":["festivals"],"s":{},"n":"Prizes and award ceremonies belong with ceremonies. The link to school is only loose."},
  {"i":5237,"t":["actions","communication"],"s":{},"n":"An honorific verb for seeing, taught in keigo and polite speech. It is not a greeting."},
  {"i":5243,"t":["money","law"],"s":{},"n":"Ownership of property (所有者, 所有権) fits money and law. It is not an everyday hand action."},
  {"i":5254,"t":["qualities","movement"],"s":{},"n":"Used mainly as 'prompt' (速やかに対応する), so qualities comes first. Speed is the second unit."},
  {"i":5266,"t":["character","communication"],"s":{},"n":"A personality trait. 率直に言う/率直な意見 is also a key use in speaking."},
  {"i":5267,"t":["time"],"s":{},"n":"Mainly the extension of time (延長戦, 会期延長). The 'total length' sense is rare for learners."},
  {"i":5274,"t":["relationships","work"],"s":{},"n":"Visits to homes and clients (家庭訪問, 企業訪問) are the typical contexts. Travel is a loose fit."},
  {"i":5280,"t":["clothing","home"],"s":{"2":["sports"],"3":["sports"]},"n":"Hairpins and safety pins are clothing and home. Bowling pins and golf flagsticks are sports senses."},
  {"i":5330,"t":["qualities","feelings"],"s":{},"n":"It mostly describes situations (悲惨な事故), so qualities comes first and feelings second."},
  {"i":5331,"t":["relationships"],"s":{"2":["character"]},"n":"Sexual content fits relationships. エロい人 (pervy, horny) describes a person's character."},
  {"i":5335,"t":["time","transport"],"s":{},"n":"A word for delay. 電車の遅れ is one of the most common learner contexts."},
  {"i":5343,"t":["relationships","health"],"s":{},"n":"Typically a hospital visit (面会時間, 面会謝絶). Communication is too loose a fit."}
 ],
